OL,3,GNEWSACollege failed autistic son,
OL,4,Amother tells inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA high-functioning autistic student who
OL,7,Ftook his own life in the toilets of his
OL,8,Fsixth form college was failed by his
OL,9,Fschool, his mother has told a coroner.
OL,11,FSam Coutts, 18, was found dead at Queen
OL,12,FElizabeth Sixth Form College,
OL,13,FDarlington, in January, following a
OL,14,Fmeeting with bosses in which he was
OL,15,Ftold his support worker would be
OL,16,Freplaced after he revealed he had a
OL,17,Fcrush on her.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
