OL,3,GNEWSACollege failed autistic son,
OL,4,Amother tells inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt an inquest in Crook, County Durham,
OL,7,Fhis mother Kirsten Coutts said Sam
OL,8,Fwould have felt ashamed after the
OL,9,Fmeeting, which he was allowed to leave
OL,10,Falone.
OL,12,FCCTV showed he went from the meeting to
OL,13,Fthe toilets where his body was found
OL,14,Fthree hours later by the college
OL,15,Fprincipal.
